<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I cannot help it,</l><l>I’m so in love with You;</l><l>For I’ve tasted Your divine heavenly wine.</l><l>I’m soaked with Thy love,</l><l>I pour my all on You.</l><l>What my future holds for me, my Lord are Thine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I’m so attracted</l><l>By Your constraining love,</l><l>And Your Name is sweet as ointment poured forth.</l><l>I’m captivated</l><l>By Your dear Person, Lord.</l><l>Draw me from this age to pursue only You...</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
